&lt;li&gt;[CHANGE] Reduce log noise &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3774375942&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1517&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1517/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1517&quot;&gt;#1517&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CHANGE] Fail if &lt;code&gt;prober&lt;/code&gt; config contains invalid value &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3808738178&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1521&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1521/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1521&quot;&gt;#1521&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Add websocket connection prober &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2459678744&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1278&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1278/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1278&quot;&gt;#1278&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Add probe timeout metric &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4256526517&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1571&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1571/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1571&quot;&gt;#1571&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Add tcp and unix prober metric for &lt;code&gt;tls_cipher_info&lt;/code&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4396420991&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1579&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1579/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1579&quot;&gt;#1579&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Add CRL certificate revocation checking &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4477290625&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1583&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1583/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1583&quot;&gt;#1583&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] prober: Handle single and double encoded target parameter &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3845134928&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1525&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1525/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1525&quot;&gt;#1525&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] prober: Randomize ICMP echo identifier to avoid SNAT session collision &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3905202729&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1537&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1537/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1537&quot;&gt;#1537&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
