  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/41964498/v0.28.0</id>
    <updated>2025-12-06T13:32:18Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/releases/tag/v0.28.0"/>
    <title>0.28.0 / 2025-12-04</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;BREAKING CHANGES:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The &lt;code&gt;--log.prober&lt;/code&gt; flag behavior has changed. The scrape probe logger is now an independent logger. Please review the README.md and adjust configurations as needed. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3384435190&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1461&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1461/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1461&quot;&gt;#1461&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Log leveling has been improved for several prober modules. Changes include logging errors at &lt;code&gt;ERROR&lt;/code&gt; level instead of &lt;code&gt;INFO&lt;/code&gt;, and adjusting many prober logs from &lt;code&gt;INFO&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;DEBUG&lt;/code&gt; level. To see more detailed probe logs, set &lt;code&gt;--log.prober=debug&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3384435190&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1461&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1461/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1461&quot;&gt;#1461&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Changes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CHANGE] Make default HTTP User-Agent compliant with RFC9110 (now &lt;code&gt;Blackbox-Exporter/&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;) &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3280578890&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1446&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1446/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1446&quot;&gt;#1446&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CHANGE] Config is not reloaded if the file content didn&#39;t change when using all reload methods &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3410527965&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1464&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1464/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1464&quot;&gt;#1464&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Support HTTP/3 (QUIC) prober &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3134160025&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1425&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1425/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1425&quot;&gt;#1425&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Add support for configuring gRPC metadata in gRPC prober &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;1331124628&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/956&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/956/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/956&quot;&gt;#956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Implement byte matching in TCP query responses &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3235462663&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1441&quot;&gt;#1441&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Add a new type of probe using unix domain sockets &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3544242164&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1480&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1480/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1480&quot;&gt;#1480&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Support config reload automatically - feature flag &lt;code&gt;config.enable-auto-reload&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;config.auto-reload-interval&lt;/code&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3410527965&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1464&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1464/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1464&quot;&gt;#1464&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[BUGFIX] Fix retrieving probe logs by target name when probed by multiple modules &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2356984435&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1257&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1257/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1257&quot;&gt;#1257&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[BUGFIX] Fix error handling in auto-reload config case &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3510058555&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1478&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1478/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1478&quot;&gt;#1478&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[BUGFIX] Fix &lt;code&gt;debug&lt;/code&gt; param log output work regardless of log level &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3210923165&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1438&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1438/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1438&quot;&gt;#1438&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
