&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Reports Certificate Serial number &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2724501085&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1333&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1333/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1333&quot;&gt;#1333&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] Enable misspell linter &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2319809970&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1248&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1248/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1248&quot;&gt;#1248&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] Fix incorrect parameters name in documentation &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;1916761532&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/issues/1126&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1126/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prometheus/blackbox_exporter/pull/1126&quot;&gt;#1126&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
